{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213937-exalted-pc-character-background-questionnaire","id":1213937,"title":"Exalted PC character background questionnaire??","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-01T16:00:13-07:00","id":1213937,"title":"Exalted PC character background questionnaire??","content":"Does anybody pnow of a good questionnaire for making backgrounds for Solars or exalts in general?<br /> <br /> I have some players that, while they have a rough concept of their character, almost can't find a name for their character.<br /> <br /> I have let the start with amnesia, but I feel some structure may let their creative juices flow. They are also completely knew to the setting.<br /> <br /> Some ideas for key questions for such a questionnaire would also be appreciated.<br /> <br /> Peace out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T05:12:10-07:00","id":1214110,"title":"","content":"While I don't have one on hand, I can at least throw around some things. If you already have a starting region figured out, that helps, and having the players read about that region and surrounding areas could potentially give them things to work with.<br /> <br /> Where is your character from? Is it close to where the game is starting? If it's far, how'd they get here and why?<br /> <br /> What was your character's life like before Exaltation? What was their place in society? How did that life shape them into the character they are now?<br /> <br /> What was the inciting incident for their Exaltation? How has their life changed since then?<br /> <br /> Why do they have whatever Supernal Ability they have? What do they intend to do with it?<br /> <br /> What do they think about their Exaltation?<br /> <br /> Generally ask them why they have anything significant, though it doesn't need to be a really tough question.<br /> ~~For Abilities at 4 dots or higher, what drove them to become so skilled in that field?<br /> ~~If they have any artifacts and/or hearthstones, how'd they get those? Did they find them, steal them, receive them as a gift? If they stole them, who's looking for the thief? If it was a gift, who gave it and for what purpose?<br /> ~~If they know Sorcery and/or Martial Arts, where'd they learn them? Who taught them and why?<br /> <br /> Did they have enemies before Exaltation? What about enemies post-Exaltation? Do any of these enemies know the Solar is a Solar?<br /> <br /> What do they want to achieve, both in terms of big and small things? How far would they go for each of those goals? At what point would they be content to just sit back and go &quot;welp, I done it&quot; if any?<br /> <br /> Encourage them to fill out their Intimacies, even with little things that seem inconsequential---it can help them figure out their character more. Things as small as a favorite season, a color they don't like, their comfort food, a nagging parent, etc can be good.<br /> <br /> Are there things they want to find out? Rumors they've heard and want to investigate?<br /> <br /> If you can, you could encourage each player to have a secret the other players don't know about.<br /> <br /> Hope any of that helps!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T05:23:24-07:00","id":1214114,"title":"","content":"Most exalted acquire influence early in gameplay. Why not give them a point or two from the start and ask them how they got it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T04:01:49-07:00","id":1214517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213937-exalted-pc-character-background-questionnaire?p=1214114#post1214114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most exalted acquire influence early in gameplay. Why not give them a point or two from the start and ask them how they got it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Great idea. Sadly not possible in this instance as had them start with anmesia in a isolated place, which they now have left, after fighting/discovering their way out (with newly accuried artifacts).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T06:40:12-07:00","id":1215019,"title":"","content":"Hey this can rigging so there also one specially for each exalt type. Like the dynasts properly have some other questions than lunars... if you play it rather straightforward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T09:29:37-07:00","id":1215102,"title":"","content":"I feel your pain. Getting my Shadowrun players to even think about their characters' backgrounds, let alone write anything, is like pulling teeth. I don't have a set list of questions, but I do like to have a short interview. I usually start with the basics (where are you from, do you have any family, how did you become a runner, etc.) and follow up on anything that seems interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T10:02:23-07:00","id":1215124,"title":"","content":"Following up on one the things Beans said, definitely make sure they explain where ALL of their starting Story Merits came/come from and who their Allies/Contacts/etc. are exactly. Doesn't have to be in much detail but if you don't have at least general answers to those questions then it'll be hard to keep certain of the merits in question from becoming wasted dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T10:51:40-07:00","id":1215146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213937-exalted-pc-character-background-questionnaire?p=1215124#post1215124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Following up on one the things Beans said, definitely make sure they explain where ALL of their starting Story Merits came/come from and who their Allies/Contacts/etc. are exactly. Doesn't have to be in much detail but if you don't have at least general answers to those questions then it'll be hard to keep certain of the merits in question from becoming wasted dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. Almost helps keeping the starting narrative more structured. Which I think we gonna need as soon as the game is getting a bit more tracktion and gains speed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}